# Titan 2 side · bottom (device: gpio_key-func, Linux scan 250).
# Left edge, lower programmable button.
#
# Intentionally NO key mapping. Android InputReader drops unmapped EV_KEY
# codes — so the system never sees Home/Recents/BUTTON_*. Pad-agent
# getevent owns this scan exclusively for remaps (layout hold/toggle, etc.).
# (Was APP_SWITCH / BUTTON_* — KeyGesture still treated those as nav/home.)
